{# The tab row of the Proxmox console, on EVERY screen of the area.

   This area is deliberately absent from the application's menus, so this strip is the only way from
   one of its screens to the next: without it each one would be a dead end you leave by retyping a
   URL. The rule it enforces is that every feature must be reachable by clicking from
   /infrastructure - a screen you can only open by knowing its address is a bug here.

   It used to be a shape of its own (`cm-localnav`), on the argument that tabs switch between views
   of one screen while this moves between screens. That distinction is not one the application makes
   anywhere else: Paramètres > Pédagogique, Partages and UFA all tab between separate routes through
   the shared partial. So this uses the same one, and the card that follows carries
   .cm-card--tabbed so it fuses with the active tab.

   Every entry is host-free. « Machines » and « Images » used to need a host to point at, which is
   what the « Aller à… » box beside the tabs existed to change - a jump list is a poor filter, and
   it made two of the seven screens the only ones you could not simply click. Both now read every
   declared host and filter in the bar, the way the operations journal already did.

   Entries appear as their screens are built; there is deliberately no disabled entry for a screen
   that does not exist yet - a link that goes nowhere teaches nothing. #}
{% include '_tabs.html.twig' with {
    tabs: [
        {url: path('app_infrastructure'), label: 'infrastructureOverviewNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'overview'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_hosts'), label: 'infrastructureHostsNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'hosts'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_guests'), label: 'infrastructureGuestsNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'guests'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_images'), label: 'infrastructureImagesNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'images'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_ip_ranges'), label: 'infrastructureAddressesNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'ip_ranges'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_batches'), label: 'infrastructureBatchesNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'batches'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_operations'), label: 'infrastructureOperationsNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'operations'},
        {url: path('app_infrastructure_console_sessions'), label: 'consoleSessionsNavLabel'|trans, active: activeNav == 'console_sessions'},
    ],
} %}
